# Generated benchmark output -- these are produced by running
# `python -m src.run_benchmark` and `python -m src.generate_report`.
#
# IMPORTANT FOR THIS PROJECT: after you run the benchmark for real and get
# real numbers, DO commit results/*.csv, results/*.json, and report/*.html
# -- this is a portfolio project, and a recruiter looking at the GitHub repo
# without cloning it should be able to see real output (the report.html,
# the results table) directly on GitHub. Don't leave this section ignoring
# them once you have real data; delete the three lines below at that point.
results/*.csv
results/*.json
report/*.html
!results/.gitkeep
!report/.gitkeep

# HF / torch cache if run locally in-repo
.cache/
*.pt
*.bin
